  "sync_mt_title": "MetaTrader / Exness Sync",
  "sync_mt_desc": "This token connects your trading software to TradeDiscipline to automatically sync your trades. It works with MetaTrader (MT4/MT5), Exness (which runs on MT4/MT5), and cTrader and NinjaTrader below — one token for all your platforms. Do not share it — it grants access to push trades to your account.",
