  "sync_mt_step4_rest": "Check \"Allow algorithmic trading\" and \"Allow WebRequests for listed URLs\", then add the URL",
  "sync_mt_step5_bold": "Drag the Expert Advisor",
  "sync_mt_step5_window": "onto any chart. In the window that opens: tab",
  "sync_mt_step5_general": "Common",
  "sync_mt_step5_check": "→ check \"Allow algo trading\" (MT5) / \"Allow live trading\" (MT4); tab",
  "sync_mt_step5_params5": "Inputs",
  "sync_mt_step5_params4": "Inputs",
  "sync_mt_step5_rest": "(MT4) → paste the token into the field.",
  "sync_mt_step6_bold": "Confirm.",
  "sync_mt_step6_rest": "Trades from the past 90 days will sync, then new trades arrive automatically as long as MetaTrader stays open.",
  "sync_mt_tips_title": "Good to know",
  "sync_mt_tip1": "TradeDiscipline shows net P&L (commissions and fees included); this may differ from the gross profit shown in MetaTrader.",
  "sync_mt_tip2": "Sync works while MetaTrader is open on your computer.",
  "sync_mt_tip_exness": "Using Exness? Exness runs on the MetaTrader terminal (MT4 or MT5). Download MetaTrader from Exness, log in to your Exness account, then follow the exact same steps above — the Expert Advisor installs into that terminal.",
  "sync_mt_modal_title": "Regenerate token?",
  "sync_mt_modal_desc": "The current token will immediately become invalid. You will need to reconfigure the Expert Advisor in MetaTrader with the new token.",
  "sync_uses_token_above": "This platform uses the same sync token as above (MetaTrader section). No need to generate another one.",
  "sync_ctrader_title": "cTrader Sync",
  "sync_ctrader_desc": "Install the TradeDiscipline cBot in cTrader to automatically sync your trades (IC Markets, Pepperstone, FxPro and other cTrader brokers).",
  "sync_ctrader_guide_title": "How to connect cTrader",
  "sync_ctrader_step1": "Download the cBot above, then open cTrader → Automate tab (robot icon on the left).",
  "sync_ctrader_step2": "Create a new cBot, paste the code from the downloaded file, then build it (hammer icon / Build).",
  "sync_ctrader_step3": "Add the cBot to any chart. cTrader will ask for network access permission — accept it.",
  "sync_ctrader_step4": "In the cBot parameters, paste your sync token into the dedicated field.",
  "sync_ctrader_step5": "Click Play. The last 90 days of history are sent, then each newly closed position syncs automatically.",
  "sync_ctrader_tip": "Sync works while cTrader stays open with the cBot active. The cBot only reads your history — it never opens or closes any position.",
  "sync_ninja_title": "NinjaTrader Sync (futures)",
  "sync_ninja_desc": "Install the TradeDiscipline AddOn in NinjaTrader 8 to sync your futures trades (prop accounts like Apex, Topstep, and futures brokers).",
  "sync_ninja_token_note": "Before compiling, paste your token (above) into the SyncToken constant at the top of the file.",
  "sync_ninja_guide_title": "How to connect NinjaTrader",
  "sync_ninja_step1": "Download the AddOn above and open it. Paste your token into the SyncToken constant (between quotes) at the top of the file.",
  "sync_ninja_step2": "In NinjaTrader: Tools menu → NinjaScript Editor. Right-click AddOns → New AddOn, then paste the code.",
  "sync_ninja_step3": "Compile with F5 and fix any errors shown at the bottom.",
  "sync_ninja_step4": "Restart NinjaTrader. The AddOn starts automatically and syncs every closed trade while NinjaTrader is connected.",
  "sync_ninja_tip": "The AddOn only reads your trade history — it never sends or modifies any order.",
